WEBVTT

00:08:57.841 --> 00:09:01.402
at being able to control
and manipulate fire.

00:09:02.456 --> 00:09:05.585
I made a conscious decision
to step out of my grief.

00:09:06.356 --> 00:09:07.927
It was not easy.

00:09:07.951 --> 00:09:11.190
There's a Nirvana lyric that says
"I miss the comfort of being sad,"

00:09:11.214 --> 00:09:12.795
and that was exactly it.

00:09:12.819 --> 00:09:15.040
I was in control of my sadness.

00:09:15.064 --> 00:09:18.083
I knew what it would bring to me,
and I knew what to expect,

00:09:18.107 --> 00:09:20.288
but I also knew deep down that eventually,

00:09:20.312 --> 00:09:24.532
I had to do that really hard work
of trying to heal from my past.

00:09:25.268 --> 00:09:27.594
So I kept practicing.

00:09:27.618 --> 00:09:30.633
I took a plastic grocery bag,
cut it into strips,